Build against pango >= 1.44, which removed the PANGO_ENABLE_BACKEND
declarations (pango_font_metrics_new, pango_config_key_get) from its
public headers while still exporting the symbols, dropped the
find_shaper member from PangoFontClass, and extended the script_shape
vfunc signature with the enclosing paragraph.

--- a/pangox.c
+++ b/pangox.c
